The portable C in the scenario view-window: what it is expected to show
otherwise than the original. A patch of harness/goldens/view-window.txt, see
harness/goldens.py: a line with - is the golden's, a line with + is what is
expected in its place.
Deviation: 19 of src/portable_c/DEVIATIONS.md
Why: the Info panel counts each file of the other panel in whole clusters in
32 bits. LAST.DAT of STAMPS, 4,294,967,295 bytes, lies inside the last cluster
below a multiple of 65,536 clusters of 512 bytes, 32 MB, where the original's
count of 16 bits wraps round to 0: it counts 32 MB more here. The sum of the
seven files wraps at 4 GB in both, so the figure is 33,554,432 bytes higher
and neither is the 6 GB that the files take

